 "sentences": [
  "Gravitational waves could reveal hidden alien worlds.",
  "The upcoming LISA observatory will detect ripples in space-time caused by orbiting masses.",
  "NASA scientists found that planets orbiting double white dwarf systems imprint signals onto these waves.",
  "This creates sidebands in the signal, acting like radio messages about a planet's presence.",
  "The James Webb Space Telescope can then confirm these discoveries by detecting their unique infrared light."
